{"parse": {"title": "11TH-15", "pageid": 110487, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-14\" title=\"11TH-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">11TH-15</span><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-16\" title=\"11TH-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">11TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9B.9E.E4.BF.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"回信\">回信</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 回信</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Send-off</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 16px; margin-bottom: -5px;\"><span class=\"item-link mode-middle mode-bonus\" data-itemid=\"1/220111\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><div class=\"item-bonus-probability star-5\"><span>首通</span></div><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A1%9D%E7%83%9F%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E\" title=\"硝烟之后\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A1%9D%E7%83%9F%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E\" title=\"硝烟之后\"><img alt=\"硝烟之后\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/Item-220113.png/100px-Item-220113.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/Item-220113.png/150px-Item-220113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/Item-220113.png/200px-Item-220113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span><div class=\"item-middle-count\">1</div></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>回<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>首<span class=\"color-value\"></span>佶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>屈<span class=\"color-value\"></span>聱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>牙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>古<span class=\"color-value\"></span>代<span class=\"color-value\"></span>诗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11115</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_gongmu3\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_gongmu3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu3.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu3.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu3.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_gongmu3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>你果然在这里，艾伯哈特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>你来了，保罗。前线如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>他们昨晚在办宴会，一切都很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>一切都很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他满意地重复着。相比上一次相见，艾伯哈特的精神已经发生了显著的改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>我以为基金会不会允许你自由活动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>不，我的使命已经完成了。蒙佩我已经待不下去了，里面全都是西装革履的大人物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他长舒一口气，在清晨的空气中伸展四肢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>那个红头发的官员同意我出来走走，他说，“会有人看着我”——管他呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>天又变冷了……但我也很喜欢这样清冷的早晨。它让我想起过去读书的日子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>在冬天的时候，天还没亮时就要起床。不过通常我会等到你骑着自行车，在我家楼下喊人的时候才睁眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>这样我们两个都会错过拉丁文课。还有瓦尔特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>哈哈哈，就是这样。拉丁文才是真正的地狱呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>瓦尔特……我真为他惋惜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>保罗从外套内取出一只揉皱的信封。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>这是我从蒙佩替你取来的包裹，还没有来得及给你，里面只有这一封信件。是穆伦贝格先生写给三班学生的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>穆伦贝格……在假期里我准备去亲自探望他，但在家乡发生的事情，你也已经知道了。我没有来得及见他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>他从来不知道前线发生了什么，打下蒙佩之后，三班的学生只剩下你和我了。他还在给谁写信呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>打开它吧，保罗，你念给我听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>保罗深沉地换了一口气，随后撕开信封。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他展开信纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“同学们，及战士们：战争正进行到最关键的时刻。作为你们的老师，我有义务为各位提振信心。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“虽然你们身在前线，但不一定能将眼下的局势把握准确。我要告诉你们的是——胜利就在眼前。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“前线的日子虽然艰苦，但要考虑到，你们正在为更加伟大的事业献身。那么苦难也应当是甘甜的。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“……这将是你们一生中最光荣的时刻，如同我教育过你们的，在未来，这些痛苦会成为回忆中的欢乐。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>欢乐？你听听这，他一定是在抄袭卢坎……还是维吉尔？我有印象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>也许是维吉尔。他在后面还引用了一个短句，命运眷顾勇者[Audentis Fortuna iuvat]。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>那关于欢乐的那一句……Forsan……Haec……后面是什么？也许是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>你弄丢了一个词，艾伯哈特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>也许有一天，回忆这些痛苦也是一种快乐[Forsan et haec olim meminisse iuvabit]。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>没错，就是这一句！这个老东西被我们逮住了，这根本不是他自己说的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>总之，他就是个没脑筋的老头，根本不明白自己在说什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苦涩的笑声过后，二人都沉默了一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>……保罗，我不会因为回想这一天而快乐的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>如果我有孩子，我要怎么告诉他我年轻时的故事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>我让自己的同胞冒着机枪和炮火冲上必死的阵地，而我明明知道，敌人在几小时后就能夺回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>他们白白送死，而这一切只是为了完成一个不知所云的命令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>……我听够了，把信收起来吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>保罗缓缓将信折起。<br />艾伯哈特却一把夺过信纸，揉成一团，扔到纪念碑旁的杂草中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前线已经停火，不再有轰鸣声从遥远的地方翻滚而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阳光落在草叶、墓碑与鸟羽上，人们可以静静观赏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>你能懂吗，我从来没有这么好过，好像在这一刻，我能——或者我已经掌握了自己的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>活着的感觉如此美好，我的胸中也不再有沉重的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>我犯下的错误也许无法洗清，我已经决定我唯一能走的那条道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他望向山坡的顶端，情不自禁地向上迈步。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_at_gaobie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_at_gaobie\"><img alt=\"3_0_at_gaobie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-3_0_at_gaobie.png/600px-Cg-3_0_at_gaobie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-3_0_at_gaobie.png/900px-Cg-3_0_at_gaobie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-3_0_at_gaobie.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_at_gaobie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>……你应该回去读书，学校花名册上还留着你的名字，课本与笔记也寄存在了学校的仓库中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>你还会回学校吗，保罗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>我也许不会，但你还可以继续学业。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>他们还会教给我们更多的知识，我们还要经历更多的考试……我还需要一份中学毕业证书吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>可我感觉我已经成为了另外一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>艾伯哈特——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>不行的，保罗。现在已经太迟了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>接下来我要一个人去散个步，请你给穆伦贝格先生写一封回信吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>今日有十足的好天气，艾伯哈特开始像郊游登山的学生那样攀上山坡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>难得的明媚阳光与恰到好处的清冷令人神清气爽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>天很蓝……战争结束了，保罗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>就像过去一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾伯哈特：</div><div>就像过去一样……这话真好。再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他挥舞手臂，转身离去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_at_gaobie3_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_at_gaobie3_zone\"><img alt=\"3_0_at_gaobie3_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-3_0_at_gaobie3_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_0_at_gaobie3_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-3_0_at_gaobie3_zone.png/900px-Cg-3_0_at_gaobie3_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-3_0_at_gaobie3_zone.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_at_gaobie3_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>保罗立在原地，将笔记本摊开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“穆伦贝格先生：您寄来的信件已由您的学生签收。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“他们共同度过了最黑暗与困苦的时光，曾在悲苦中相拥而泣。而现在一切业已结束。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“他们是勇敢的人，忠诚的人……但是，这些品质在某些时刻变得过于沉重，并非他们年轻的肩膀所能承载。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“故而我不愿意用这些词来为他们增添更多荣耀。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“战火让年轻人变成另一副模样，您教授他们的知识不再有用武之地，而他们也无法再度聆听您的教诲。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“此刻，我不得不用最沉重的心情告诉您——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“十三年级三班的学生已经全部阵亡。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保罗：</div><div>“——谨致敬意。一个已死之人。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“这是关于士兵保罗·霍伊默尔的记录。”</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "11TH-15"}}